@startuml
title APT-SD-D06 Statutory Discount Capture and Payable-Basis Refresh Sequence
skinparam shadowing false

actor Cashier
participant "Assisted Payment Terminal" as APT
participant "Central PMS / Discount workflow" as Discount
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Operator Console\nnon-payment review" as OC
participant "Audit / Event" as Audit

Cashier -> APT : initiate statutory discount capture
APT -> APT : capture entitlement details,\nevidence reference, attestation
APT -> Discount : submit validation request
Discount -> Discount : policy resolution + persistence
alt approved
  Discount -> Central : payable-basis effect
  Central -> Central : refresh payable basis
  Central --> APT : display updated payable basis
else rejected / failed / expired
  Discount --> APT : display non-approved result
else pending review
  Discount -> OC : supervisor/compliance review handoff
  OC --> APT : review status via backend
end
Discount -> Audit : validation and evidence context

note bottom
APT captures inputs only.
Central PMS / Discount workflow owns policy decision and payable-basis effect.
end note
@enduml
